PLACEHOLDER — replace with a real 1024x1024 PNG icon for production builds.
The designer must provide:
  - icon.png        — 1024x1024 PNG with transparent background
  - icon.ico        — Windows multi-resolution ICO (16/24/32/48/64/128/256)
  - icon.icns       — macOS ICNS (16/32/64/128/256/512/1024)
  - icon-linux-512.png — Linux AppImage icon

Branding guidelines (spec §19):
  - The Smart EDMS mark uses the primary brand color on a transparent or
    dark surface. Both light and dark variants must have AA contrast.
  - The mark must NOT be modified per locale. The wordmark "Smart EDMS"
    stays consistent across locales (descriptive text translates, product
    name does not).
